2. Favicon & App Icon Concept
When scaling down to tiny resolutions (e.g., $16\times16\text{px}$ or $32\times32\text{px}$ in browser tabs), complex circuit lines and small stars become unreadable. The favicon uses a simplified mark that retains brand identity while maximizing legibility.
Design Breakdown
Icon Structure: A single continuous, high-contrast "Interlocking Infinity Node" curve without internal circuit lines.
Key Accent: The upward-pointing arrow is bolded and slightly enlarged to remain sharp at $16\text{px}$.
Background: Clean rounded rectangle (Squircle) using Deep Navy (#0F172A) to ensure high visibility across light and dark browser themes.

